WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.350
How to ask the district anything, in 20 seconds.

2
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:05.500
Step 1: Open the link in our bio. On school Wi-Fi? Use your phone's data.

3
00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.250
Step 2: Tap "Ask the District."

4
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:11.600
Step 3: Type one question. Student names never go on the site.

5
00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.750
Step 4: We send it to the right person.

6
00:00:14.750 --> 00:00:17.700
Step 5: The real answer gets posted. Word for word.

7
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.900
Your school. Your say. @spasdstudentvoice
